  "changes": [
    "Capture transaction-provider replica scope and stale mode in the shared statement context; distinguish tidb_snapshot from stale routing despite the shared historical catalog adapter.",
    "Point/batch/prepared snapshot options and pushdown statement context carry the same captured consistency. Coprocessor request building consumes it instead of reconstructing closest-only scope.",
    "Native snapshot Get/BatchGet applies stale mode after replica configuration reset; a following ordinary statement clears it. Low-level Scan retains the separate client-go non-stale construction. Native source and synchronization pins are unchanged.",
    "Remove duplicated reader-side scope decisions and condense the three current finding descriptions; original repair evidence remains linked. Preserve Go-derived/Rust-correctness tests."
  ],
